      "mergeID": "674101d658146a0572e41475",
      "mergedPostDetails": "Modified clients sending malicious Network Events has been a problem in my multiplayer game worlds. We can already prefix event names with an underscore to prevent them from being invoked from SendCustomNetworkEvent, but some events need to be networked for the purposes of the game, usually invoked by the Master as I give the Master  authority over game events like Start Game, Game Over, etc.\nIt would be nice to have some events only be allowed to be invoked by the Master. For example, similar to how _EventName is discarded if it comes from any other player, maybe __EventName (double underscore?) could be discarded if it comes from any payer other than the master.",
      "mergedPostTitle": "Mark certain network events as \"From Master Only\"",
